  "description": "Furnished one bedroom apartment set in the well kept surroundings of The Coast, Baldoyle (access from Grange Road). This modern apartment is part of a duplex and is on the second/top floor and has it's own entrance. It has an open plan kitchen and living room, a spacious bedroom with double bed, fitted wardrobes and a bathroom with a bath/shower.\n\nThere is a private communal garden per block available to residents and one allocated parking space however there is plenty of visitor parking available for a second car if required.\n\nAll mod cons in the kitchen, central heating throughout. Very economical apartment to run, no refuse charges.\n\nAccess to Clongriffin dart station, 29a and 15 bus routes are all less then 10 minutes walk.\n\nHowth Junction is approx 15 minutes walk.\n\nLidl is 10 minutes walk, Donaghmede Shopping Centre is a walkable distance or a 5 minute drive.\n\nScenic walks along the coast and access to Baldoyle park are only a short distance away.\n\nViewings available by appointment only.",
